Package: clima
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, geoclue-2.0
Description: Weather app for Chile: 346 communes, animated sky
 Current weather, 24 hours and 10 days for the 346 communes of Chile, with an
 animated sky, air-quality alerts (PM2.5), vehicle restriction, school-
 suspension risk, moon phase and tides. Data from Open-Meteo. Includes the
 clima command-line tool. Documentation and interface in Spanish.
